//RS //! Generated, typed Source-MIR <-> native MIR conversion for the private bootstrap.
//RS //!
//RS //! This module is deliberately a generator, rather than a handwritten carrier
//RS //! projection.  The source MIR declarations and the binding manifest are the
//RS //! inputs to the generator; every source field and variant is resolved through
//RS //! the checked symbols before Rust glue is emitted.  A schema drift therefore
//RS //! fails bootstrap artifact construction instead of becoming an opaque value or
//RS //! a silently dropped field.
